      "writtenOn": "2022-12-06T01:02:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s more a heads-up to vendors that that is how we (audio framework) intend to use that method. \n\nI can\u0027t think of a scenario where the system would ever need to use this method outside of engine initialization, but I also don\u0027t know that we need to say \"This method must only be called ...\"",
